  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through GENDER EQUALITY in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GENDER EQUALITY will empower youth (age 12-30) in Kiryandongo refugee settlement with skills and knowledge to eradicate persistent cultural practices that harass and dismiss voices of women both in private and public spheres. Youth will also use acquired knowledge to challenge traditional attitudes preventing young women&#x2019;s education. Youth and particularly women will have access to safe spaces where they will receive services such as modern contraceptives.</narrative>
  </description>
